  "implemented": [
    "parsePmsExcelRows(File) recognizes exact CFB signature and only then dynamically imports pms-excel-binary-import.ts; both page-level premature OLE rejection branches removed",
    "CFB3/CFB4 header, regular FAT and chained DIFAT, directory root workbook lookup, MiniFAT/mini-stream, finite-chain/truncation/duplicate guards",
    "BIFF8 workbook globals, first ordinary worksheet via BoundSheet8 offset; multiple sheets do not mix",
    "Shared Unicode SST and rich/extended text; compressed and UTF16LE string characters may change encoding across CONTINUE without corrupting next string",
    "NUMBER, signed/scaled/float RK, MULRK, BOOLERR, LABELSST/LABEL, saved formula numeric/Boolean/string/blank caches; never execute or recalculate formulas",
    "1900/1904 Excel dates from XF/custom or built-in number formats return canonical date/time strings required by import fields",
    "Encrypted CFB/BIFF FilePass, old BIFF, invalid/unhandled cell structure, corrupt chains/records/indices and duplicate cell/format definitions are actionable failures, never binary-to-CSV fallback",
    "OOXML remains ZIP/DEFLATE reader with first worksheet relationship, rich shared text, numeric/date/style handling, boundary checks; HTML .xls templates and UTF8 CSV remain supported"
  ],
